    "summary": "This policy applies to 49 specialty drug HCPCS J-codes. When administered in physician office or home health settings, drugs must be obtained through the BJC Pharmacy Benefit Plan specialty pharmacy and are not billed to the medical plan; prior authorization is not required. When administered in inpatient, outpatient, emergency room, or urgent care settings, the carve-out does not apply; facilities may dispense and bill the medical benefit directly, and pre-certification is required."
